摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeekharness agent预设模式文档生成助手","id":"gh:1334807143","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-doc-generator","slug":"chenjiajungithub/dsh-doc-generator","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeekharness agent预设模式文档生成助手"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-doc-generator"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A DeepSeek Harness **agent preset** that generates compliant documents from a\n> Word (`.docx`) tem"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"plate by asking an LLM to write the content, then rendering a\n> new `.docx` that inherits the templa"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"te's styling.\n>\n> 中文说明见 README.zh-CN.md."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Given a Word template such as `template.docx`, this preset equips the agent with\nthree tools that ru"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"template such as `template.docx`, this preset equips the agent with\nthree tools that run end to end:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Tool | Signature | Purpose |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| `parseTemplate` | `parseTemplate(templatePath)` | Parse a `.docx`: extract placeholders (`{{title}"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"}`, `{{author}}`, …), the outline (heading hierarchy, paragraphs, lists), and inherited style rules "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"(default font/size). |\n| `draftDocument` | `draftDocument(requirements, contentPoints, writingStyle?"},{"id":"p7s4","text":")` | Ask the configured DeepSeek model to produce complete, spec-compliant Markdown for the given st"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ructure and content points. |\n| `exportWord` | `exportWord(content, templatePath?, outputPath?)` | R"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ender the Markdown into a standard `.docx` that inherits the template styling. |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A typical flow:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Why this architecture"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness Host plugin cannot `require` third-party packages from its own\nmodule scope, so a"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ll OOXML reading/writing is delegated to two **Node helper\nscripts** shipped with the preset under `"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ading/writing is delegated to two **Node helper\nscripts** shipped with the preset under `dscg-lib/`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- `dscg-lib/parse-template.js` — reads the template and prints structured JSON.\n- `dscg-lib/generate"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"-docx.js` — renders Markdown to `.docx`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The plugin shells out to `node` through the harness `shell` service and uses `fs`\nto write scratch J"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"SON spec files. `draftDocument` reuses the harness `llm` stream\nAPI to call the active DeepSeek mode"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"N spec files. `draftDocument` reuses the harness `llm` stream\nAPI to call the active DeepSeek model."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Because the plugin only registers tools into the host `tools` registry and exposes\nno service, its c"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"omposition row sits loose in the preset (like `tool-fs` /\n`tool-web`) and **does not need an `isolat"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"row sits loose in the preset (like `tool-fs` /\n`tool-web`) and **does not need an `isolate` realm**."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> **Requirements for a regular Cordis plugin loaded by the Loader** (these were\n> the exact source o"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"f mount failures on first authoring):\n> 1. `export const inject = ['tools']` — declared before `ctx."},{"id":"p15s3","text":"tools` is used, or\n>    the Guard rejects with `cannot get property \"tools\" without inject`.\n> 2. ev"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ery `ctx.tools.register(...)` tool must declare `output: { schema, render }`.\n> 3. use the namespace"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" export shape (`name` / `inject` / `apply`, **no default\n>    export**) — a default would make `Load"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"er.unwrapExports` drop `inject`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"This repository **is** the preset directory: copy it into your agent-presets root\nto deploy. The com"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"position and the plugin resolve **relative to this directory**."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"After `npm install`, the plugin's `depsRoot` defaults to this repository root, so\nno extra configura"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"all`, the plugin's `depsRoot` defaults to this repository root, so\nno extra configuration is needed."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Deploy as a DeepSeek Harness agent preset — quick clone guide"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The repository root **is** the preset directory, so deploying is a clone (or copy)\ninto your Harness"},{"id":"p23s2","text":" user-preset root plus an `npm install`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"#### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- A DeepSeek Harness deployment running with agent presets enabled (the\n`agent-presets` roster mount"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"s presets from `${DSH_HOME}/.agent-presets`, where\n`DSH_HOME` defaults to `${HOME}/.dsh`).\n- Node.js"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" ≥ 18 and `npm` on `PATH` (to install `docx` +\n`mammoth`).\n- `git` (only if you want the clone/keep-"},{"id":"p25s4","text":" `PATH` (to install `docx` +\n`mammoth`).\n- `git` (only if you want the clone/keep-in-sync workflow)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"#### Step 1 — clone"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"#### Step 2 — install dependencies"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`docx` and `mammoth` are the only runtime dependencies. After this, the plugin's\n`depsRoot` defaults"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" to the checked-out directory, so no extra config is needed."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"#### Step 3 — place it under the agent-presets root"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"> Alternative without `git`: just clone straight into a fresh directory under the\n> preset root and "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"run `npm install` there:\n>\n[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"#### Step 4 — start a session on the preset"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"In the Web UI, open the preset picker and choose **文档生成助手** (Document\nGenerator), then create a new "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"session. The session tool list should include\n`parseTemplate`, `draftDocument`, and `exportWord`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Sanity check on an empty box:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"#### Updating after a release"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"> **Important — restart after an update.** The Harness Loader imports\n> relative-path plugins throug"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"h the **Node ESM module cache keyed by file URL**.\n> If you edit `index.mjs` (or `git pull` a newer "},{"id":"p40s3","text":"one) while the host is running,\n> **restart the Harness** so the corrected module is imported afresh"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"ne) while the host is running,\n> **restart the Harness** so the corrected module is imported afresh."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"#### Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| Symptom | Cause / fix |"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| `cannot get property \"tools\" without inject` | Stale cached module from before a fix — restart the"},{"id":"p43s2","text":" Harness process. |\n| `tool ... must declare output { schema, render, presentationMeta? }` | Not a r"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"untime config issue; the shipped plugin already declares `output` — make sure you are on the latest "},{"id":"p43s4","text":"`master` and restarted. |\n| Model says `no provider/model selection available` | No DeepSeek provide"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"r/model is configured on the session's route; configure one in settings. |\n| `exportWord` fails to p"},{"id":"p43s6","text":"roduce a file | Confirm the template path is a real `.docx` and that a writable output path is given"},{"id":"p43s7","text":" (or that `<preset>/out` is writable). |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"The preset row accepts optional `config` (all default sensibly):"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"| field | default | meaning |"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"| `defaultOutputDir` | `<repo>/out` | Where `exportWord` writes when `outputPath` is omitted. |\n| `d"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"epsRoot` | `<repo>` | Directory that *contains* `node_modules` (the helper scripts resolve `docx`/`m"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"ammoth`/`jszip` from here). |\n| `helperDir` | `<repo>/dscg-lib` | Where the helper scripts live. |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
